  "title": "· New Bags | FENDI Unveils Spring/Summer 2027 Runway Collection: Clothes as the Backdrop ·",
  "original_title": "新包 | FENDI 发布2027春夏时装秀：以衣为衬",
  "excerpt": "Fendi's Spring/Summer 2027 Milan show, led by Maria Grazia Chiuri, explores body-clothing intimacy through lingerie-inspired lace, embroidery, and layered silk prints.",
  "author": "撰稿 X Vivi 编辑 X RAN",
  "date_iso": "2026-09-29",
  "date_label": "September 29, 2026",
  "cover_image": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/anbupnu/ab84596814858f65.jpg",
  "tags": [
    "FENDI"
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The FENDI Spring/Summer 2027 runway show has just wrapped in Milan, and this season's collection centers on the bond between the body and clothing. Chief Creative Officer Maria Grazia Chiuri took the most intimate of garments — undergarments — as her starting point, using lace, embroidery and cut-out detailing to turn fabric into a second skin. Glossy and matte, weightless and substantial, silk and animal prints are layered and mixed, striking a deft balance between restraint and ease.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
