    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Chain-Strap Evening Bag ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "On the bag front, the house unveiled a newly designed chain-strap clutch, featuring a minimalist flap silhouette finished with a scarab-shaped clasp. The detachable jeweled chain echoes the scarab rings worn by the models, turning the bag into a wearable jewelry accessory. It comes in exotic leathers including python and lizard.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
