    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The classic Baguette line introduces an evening-bag version in lizard leather with a diamond-embellished clasp. Its compact, jewel-like proportions take on an air of elegance and luxury, set off by the exotic leather and jeweled hardware.",
