      "text": "The Baguette® 26424 remains the headline act of the season, appearing with exotic embroidered motifs, beaded fringe, cut-out leather fretwork, animal prints, fur, metal studs and an array of other materials and decorative elements — a showcase of exquisite craftsmanship and boundless creativity.",
