    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· And More ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The My Peekbaoo bag makes its appearance in leopard-print python, channeling Italian wildness and opulent glamour. Another version, in khaki crocodile leather, is flanked by extra-long leather fringe on both sides, lending the bag a sense of movement. Totes are finished with woven leather handles, or covered entirely in cut-out leather floral appliqués for a romantic, poetic feel.",
